  "business_rules": [
    "Approval state is tracked with is_approved, is_rejected; a record with neither flag set is typically still pending.",
    "created_date is the preferred date column for period-based reporting.",
    "Use profile_completion for monetary or quantity totals.",
    "Columns buying_trigger_type, role_level classify the record; check the distinct values before filtering on them.",
    "VW_Influencers is a database view: it is read-only and its rows are computed, so apply filters and a LIMIT when querying."
